  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Additional Financing for George Price Highway Rehabilitation Project</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Financiamiento Adicional para el Proyecto de Rehabilitacin de George Price Highway</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es contribuir a la productividad y la integracin econmica de Belice. El objetivo especfico del financiamiento adicional complementario es proporcionar recursos adicionales para completar el Proyecto de Rehabilitacin George Price Highway (GPH) (3344  OC-BL), cuyo objetivo es mejorar sustancialmente la conectividad vial dentro de los principales distritos de Belice y con Amrica Central. Esto se lograr mediante la rehabilitacin de la infraestructura vial de GPH entre millas 47.9 en Belmopan y 67.3 en Santa Elena a estndares nacionales, disminuyendo as el tiempo y los costos de viaje, reduciendo las muertes y lesiones y asegurando el acceso vial mejorando el Cambio Climtico (CC ) resiliencia del corredor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to contribute to the productivity and economic integration of Belize. The specific objective of the supplementary additional financing is to provide additional resources to complete the George Price Highway (GPH) Rehabilitation Project (3344OC-BL), which aims to substantially improve the road connectivity within Belize&apos;s main districts and with Central America. This will be achieved through the rehabilitation of the GPH road infrastructure between miles 47.9 in Belmopan and 67.3 in Santa Elena to national standards, thereby decreasing travel time and costs, reducing road fatalities and injuries, and ensuring road accessibility by improving the Climate Change (CC) resilience of the corridor.</narrative>
  </description>
